"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for St. Johns County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. April to May and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 23% of normal in November to December and 49% in March to April. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 41% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
